    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# PRJ001 - Tool - Book Appointment\n\n**Purpose:** Books an appointment after authentication, validation, and availability checks.\n\n**Inputs:** `session_id`, `date_time`, `appointment_type`, `full_name`\n\n**Process:**\n1. Authenticate the customer using Redis.\n2. Validate the requested date, time, and appointment type.\n3. Calculate the appointment end time and check scheduling rules.\n4. Check Google Calendar availability.\n5. Create the appointment and save customer details.\n6. Return booking confirmation.\n\n**Error Handling:** Covers authentication, invalid dates or appointment types, scheduling conflicts, and unavailable slots.\n\n**Configuration:** Uses the shared Configuration node for timezone, working hours, lunch breaks, working days, slot intervals, and appointment durations.\n\n**Dependencies:** Redis, Google Calendar, and Configuration.",
        "height": 368,
        "width": 1088,
        "color": 4
      },
